  "facts": [
    "Reinforcement Camps take up a 3x3 space.",
    "The build cost and build time for the Reinforcement Camp increases the more you own. At Builder Hall level 10, you can have a maximum of two Reinforcement Camps. Combined with the Army Camps, this allows for a maximum of eight camps' worth of troops in a single attack."
